  "title": "12 March 1969: Paul McCartney marries Linda Eastman",
  "date": "1969-03-12",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p><a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/\">Paul McCartney</a> married <a href=\"/people/linda-mccartney/\">Linda Eastman</a> at Marylebone Register Office on 12 March 1969. <span id=\"more-3162\"></span></p><p>Although the event was supposed to be a secret, many onlookers and reporters heard about it and turned up for a glimpse of the couple. The register office had been booked the previous day, and McCartney had bought a £12 ring “just before the shop shut”.</p><blockquote><div>We were crazy. We had a big argument the night before we got married and it was nearly called off. We were very up and down, quite funky compared to the eventual image of ‘Twenty-five years of married bliss! Aren’t they lucky for people in showbiz?’ But we are. You get this picture of us swanning along in a little rowboat managing to avoid the white water, but we were right in the middle of that white water, man, so it’s even more miraculous that we made it. But we did.</div></blockquote><div class=\"source\">Paul McCartney<br>\n<a href=\"https://geni.us/manyyearsfromnow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><em>Many Years From Now</em></a>, Barry Miles</div><p>To avoid the crowds the couple entered the register office via a side door. None of the other Beatles attended the ceremony, but McCartney’s brother Michael and The Beatles’ assistant <a href=\"/people/mal-evans/\">Mal Evans</a> acted as witnesses.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1969/03/12/paul-mccartney-marries-linda-eastman/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-3162 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/69_paul-linda-mccartney_004/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTM4IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDEzOCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"138\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_paul-linda-mccartney_004-200x138.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Paul and Linda McCartney, 1969\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_paul-linda-mccartney_004-200x138.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_paul-linda-mccartney_004-580x400.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_paul-linda-mccartney_004-768x530.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_paul-linda-mccartney_004.jpg 820w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"8539\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/69_paul-linda-mccartney_004/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_paul-linda-mccartney_004.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"820,566\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Paul and Linda McCartney, 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_paul-linda-mccartney_004.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/69_paul-linda-mccartney_003/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxNzEiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTcxIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"171\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_paul-linda-mccartney_003-171x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Paul and Linda McCartney, 1969\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_paul-linda-mccartney_003-171x200.jpg 171w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_paul-linda-mccartney_003.jpg 430w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 171px) 100vw, 171px\" data-attachment-id=\"8538\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/69_paul-linda-mccartney_003/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_paul-linda-mccartney_003.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"430,502\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Paul and Linda McCartney, 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_paul-linda-mccartney_003.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/69_paul-linda-mccartney_002/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxNzgiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTc4IDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"178\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_paul-linda-mccartney_002-178x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Paul and Linda McCartney, 1969\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_paul-linda-mccartney_002-178x200.jpg 178w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_paul-linda-mccartney_002-517x580.jpg 517w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_paul-linda-mccartney_002-855x960.jpg 855w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_paul-linda-mccartney_002-768x862.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_paul-linda-mccartney_002.jpg 858w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 178px) 100vw, 178px\" data-attachment-id=\"8537\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/69_paul-linda-mccartney_002/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_paul-linda-mccartney_002.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"858,963\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Paul and Linda McCartney, 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_paul-linda-mccartney_002-855x960.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/69_paul-linda-mccartney_005/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxNDUiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTQ1IDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"145\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_paul-linda-mccartney_005-145x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Paul and Linda McCartney, 1969\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_paul-linda-mccartney_005-145x200.jpg 145w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_paul-linda-mccartney_005-421x580.jpg 421w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_paul-linda-mccartney_005-696x960.jpg 696w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_paul-linda-mccartney_005.jpg 755w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 145px) 100vw, 145px\" data-attachment-id=\"8540\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/69_paul-linda-mccartney_005/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_paul-linda-mccartney_005.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"755,1041\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Paul and Linda McCartney, 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/69_paul-linda-mccartney_005-696x960.jpg\"></a></div></figure></div><blockquote><div>I really don’t remember whether or not I invited any of the band to the wedding. Why not? I’m a total b*****d, I suppose – I don’t know, really. Maybe it was because the group was breaking up. We were all pissed off with each other. We certainly weren’t a gang any more. That was the thing. Once a group’s broken up like that, that’s it.</div></blockquote><div class=\"source\">Paul McCartney<br>\n<a href=\"https://geni.us/manyyearsfromnow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><em>Many Years From Now</em></a>, Barry Miles</div><p>Mike McCartney’s train broke down during his journey from Birmingham to London, and he arrived an hour late. Although he presumed the wedding would have finished, he took the waiting limousine to the register office, where he found huge crowds of weeping fans. Inside Paul and Linda were waiting for him to arrive.</p><div class=\"epyt-video-wrapper\"><iframe id=\"_ytid_27577\" width=\"580\" height=\"435\" data-origwidth=\"580\" data-origheight=\"435\" data-relstop=\"1\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2tBX6_98QVg?enablejsapi=1&amp;autoplay=0&amp;cc_load_policy=0&amp;cc_lang_pref=&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;loop=0&amp;rel=0&amp;fs=1&amp;playsinline=0&amp;autohide=2&amp;theme=dark&amp;color=red&amp;controls=1&amp;disablekb=0&amp;\" class=\"__youtube_prefs__  epyt-is-override  no-lazyload\" title=\"YouTube player\" allow=\"fullscreen; accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\" data-no-lazy=\"1\" data-skipgform_ajax_framebjll=\"\"></iframe></div><p>After the ceremony the wedding party went to St John’s Wood Church where the marriage was blessed by Reverend Noel Perry-Gore.</p><p>Marylebone Register Office is today known as Westminster Register Office, and is based at Westminster Council House, Marylebone Road, London.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1969/03/12/paul-mccartney-marries-linda-eastman/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-2\" class=\"gallery galleryid-3162 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/690312-paul-linda-mccartney-wedding_01/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxNjAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMTYwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"160\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690312-paul-linda-mccartney-wedding_01-160x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Paul and Linda McCartney on their wedding day, 12 March 1969\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690312-paul-linda-mccartney-wedding_01-160x200.jpg 160w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690312-paul-linda-mccartney-wedding_01-464x580.jpg 464w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690312-paul-linda-mccartney-wedding_01-768x960.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690312-paul-linda-mccartney-wedding_01.jpg 1040w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 160px) 100vw, 160px\" data-attachment-id=\"28148\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/690312-paul-linda-mccartney-wedding_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690312-paul-linda-mccartney-wedding_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1040,1300\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Paul and Linda McCartney on their wedding day, 12 March 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690312-paul-linda-mccartney-wedding_01-768x960.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/paul-mccartney/690312-paul-linda-mccartney-wedding_02/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTM2IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDEzNiI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9Ij